WEBVTT

00:26.000 --> 00:27.940
I... I...

00:28.900 --> 00:30.960
...I'm late!

00:47.090 --> 00:52.550
<i>Let's chase our dreams...</i>

00:52.660 --> 00:57.700
<i>... holding hearts burning...</i>

00:57.770 --> 01:02.100
<i>... like the summer sunshine.</i>

01:02.200 --> 01:06.040
<i>If we have courage...</i>

01:06.140 --> 01:09.200
<i>... at 100 miles an hour...</i>

01:09.310 --> 01:17.310
<i>... I'm sure the door will open.</i>

01:17.420 --> 01:24.460
<i>Since sadness is the road</i>
<i>that leads to smiles...</i>

01:24.530 --> 01:33.100
<i>... dull, dingy shoes will</i>
<i>start to shine, too.</i>

01:33.200 --> 01:39.800
<i>The most wonderful dream</i>
<i>in the world...</i>

01:39.910 --> 01:46.510
<i>The pounding beat speeds up.</i>

01:46.620 --> 01:53.680
<i>The eyes are prisms that</i>
<i>catch the wind...</i>

01:53.790 --> 02:01.560
<i>... and in the voices of</i>
<i>countless friends...</i>

02:01.630 --> 02:08.400
<i>... I feel happiness.</i>

02:11.170 --> 02:13.640
FILE. 3
LOVE'S HIGHWAY STARS

02:18.610 --> 02:19.910
"Ladies' Locker Room"

02:22.580 --> 02:23.520
Good Morning!

02:23.520 --> 02:24.920
Good Morning!
Yoriko! Good Morning!

02:26.790 --> 02:27.920
Miyuki! Good Morning!

02:27.920 --> 02:28.460
Miyuki! Good Morning!
Good Morning.

02:28.460 --> 02:28.590
Good Morning.

02:28.590 --> 02:29.830
Oh? Where's Natsumi?
Good Morning.

02:29.830 --> 02:29.960
Oh? Where's Natsumi?

02:29.960 --> 02:31.120
Oh? Where's Natsumi?
Sleeping late, as usual.

02:31.290 --> 02:33.960
You didn't wake her up?
You're living together.

02:34.330 --> 02:39.290
I tried! Ice packs, firecrackers,
BB guns, headphone blasts...

02:39.370 --> 02:41.670
...every day her immunity to wakeups
gets stronger and stronger.

02:42.740 --> 02:45.730
So, I've decided to leave
her alone from now on.

02:46.740 --> 02:50.080
We got days off this weekend, didn't we?
What's with these red marks?

02:50.250 --> 02:51.110
Huh? OH!

02:51.280 --> 02:53.110
Sorry! I couldn't help
seeing them!

02:53.350 --> 02:54.420
What's today?

02:54.420 --> 02:56.040
What's today?
Huh? It's Thursday.

02:56.220 --> 02:59.350
I completely forgot about replying!
What should I do?!

02:59.520 --> 03:03.480
Weekend? "Reply?"
This is fishy!

03:04.530 --> 03:09.020
There! I made it! No
thanks to Miyuki!

03:10.370 --> 03:11.730
Natsumi! Good morning!

03:11.730 --> 03:12.830
Natsumi! Good morning!
Oh... Morning!

03:14.070 --> 03:17.900
What's with that laugh? A-ha! I bet
you're onto something juicy again!

03:18.440 --> 03:19.740
Wanna know?

03:20.210 --> 03:22.040
I heard that Yoriko saw the evidence!

03:22.040 --> 03:23.850
I heard that Yoriko saw the evidence!
That poor Nakajima!

03:23.850 --> 03:23.980
That poor Nakajima!

03:23.980 --> 03:25.210
You think Miyuki hears her clock ticking?
That poor Nakajima!

03:25.210 --> 03:25.350
You think Miyuki hears her clock ticking?

03:25.350 --> 03:26.820
You think Miyuki hears her clock ticking?
Wouldn't you want to try it, even once?

03:26.820 --> 03:26.950
Wouldn't you want to try it, even once?

03:26.950 --> 03:27.520
Try what once?
Wouldn't you want to try it, even once?

03:27.520 --> 03:27.650
Try what once?

03:27.650 --> 03:28.850
Try what once?
Oh come on, you know what!

03:28.850 --> 03:28.980
Oh come on, you know what!

03:28.980 --> 03:30.420
You mean Nakajima wasn't #1 on her list?
Oh come on, you know what!

03:30.420 --> 03:30.550
You mean Nakajima wasn't #1 on her list?

03:30.550 --> 03:32.680
You mean Nakajima wasn't #1 on her list?
I never thought that this would happen!

03:32.850 --> 03:36.950
Good mornin'! Huh? What the?
What's with those faces?!

03:37.190 --> 03:40.360
Nakajima, I've got something to talk to
you about. Come with me for a sec.

03:40.530 --> 03:41.200
Huh?!

03:41.200 --> 03:44.930
Huh?!
Kennie!

03:47.100 --> 03:47.500
Come with me!

03:47.500 --> 03:48.640
Come with me!
Ugh! Lemme go!

03:48.640 --> 03:48.770
Ugh! Lemme go!

03:48.770 --> 03:51.400
Shut up!
Ugh! Lemme go!

03:57.450 --> 03:59.910
An "Omiai?!" But you don't
know that for sure, right?

04:00.350 --> 04:02.280
This is no time to act
so laid back!

04:02.450 --> 04:05.440
A weekend meeting that
requires an RSVP...

04:05.550 --> 04:08.520
Can it be anything other than a formal
Omiai matchmaking introduction?

04:08.660 --> 04:13.120
See! It's all your fault for not telling
her how you really feel about her!

04:14.460 --> 04:15.990
Whatcha gonna do now?!

04:16.160 --> 04:20.360
This means... you're gonna have
to kidnap her... or else!

04:20.670 --> 04:21.830
K... Kidnap her?!

04:22.000 --> 04:24.000
Don't you care if some guy
steals her away?!

04:24.170 --> 04:26.570
Take her away?! You're blowing
this out of proportion...

04:26.740 --> 04:28.970
You've got to make sure that she
doesn't make it to that meeting!

04:29.140 --> 04:30.310
What do you mean by that?

04:30.310 --> 04:33.910
What do you mean by that?
Hey! Nakajima! Are you a man or what?!

04:34.080 --> 04:35.610
Why can't you be a little more
direct for a change?!

04:35.780 --> 04:38.010
Right! If you're a man, then go after
her until you get her or drop dead!

04:38.190 --> 04:40.150
Now, now...

04:41.720 --> 04:45.090
"Would you like to go out touring,
Ms. Kobayakawa?"

04:45.190 --> 04:49.430
No, using "Ms." is weird! Hmm...
"Let's go out touring!"

04:49.530 --> 04:52.760
If I'm asking her out, then I'd
better not sound so snooty!

04:52.870 --> 04:55.430
"Why don't we go touring!
Huh? Huh?"

04:55.540 --> 04:59.130
Ehh... Now that'll make me look like
an idiot! Maybe I should just ask...

04:59.310 --> 05:00.740
What's wrong, Nakajima?

05:03.850 --> 05:08.180
Well, umm... HUH?!
Why, that's...

05:08.720 --> 05:11.520
Like it? It's Natsumi's...

05:12.550 --> 05:13.620
Tsujimoto's?!

05:13.620 --> 05:14.680
Tsujimoto's?!
Yeah.

05:14.860 --> 05:17.920
She got so excited after I put the chamber
and aluminum swing-arm on it...

05:18.030 --> 05:21.150
...that she ended up
driving it all night.

05:21.360 --> 05:23.020
But... I thought she wasn't
much of a motorhead...

05:23.200 --> 05:27.600
Well, she sure can tell when something's
changed... She can be rather picky!

05:27.740 --> 05:31.330
Oh, well, actually I wanted you to
check something out for me...

05:31.970 --> 05:34.870
What is it? As long as you don't
need it done right away...

05:35.280 --> 05:36.610
No, it can wait. I don't mind!

05:36.610 --> 05:37.980
No, it can wait. I don't mind!
I do!

05:38.150 --> 05:40.380
There's no time to get excited
over bikes, am I right?!

05:40.580 --> 05:44.040
You know well that I've told you to go
to bed early many, many times!

05:44.150 --> 05:46.180
We're 15 minutes
late for patrol!

05:46.360 --> 05:49.320
That's not it! What are you
waiting for?! C'mon!

05:49.460 --> 05:52.120
Er... er... Well... Would
you like to?

05:52.930 --> 05:54.520
What's with you two?!

05:55.930 --> 05:58.160
You see, Nakajima here...

05:58.270 --> 06:02.170
...is trying to keep you from your Omiai,
and is therefore asking you for a date!

06:02.340 --> 06:05.700
Er... er... well...

06:06.110 --> 06:09.310
He asks, "Are you free
this weekend?"

06:09.480 --> 06:11.710
Weekend? This weekend?

06:11.880 --> 06:13.680
Y... Yeah!

06:13.850 --> 06:18.340
Sorry, I have to do something
this weekend... So I can't.

06:21.520 --> 06:25.650
But, wait a minute here... Who said
anything about an Omiai?

06:26.860 --> 06:32.390
Huh?! B... But... Even Natsumi said she
had no idea about your plans, so that...

06:33.000 --> 06:34.970
Yoriko!

06:35.900 --> 06:39.970
Ah... Er... Well!

07:00.300 --> 07:03.060
Oh, I don't know about this... Maybe
I'll just come home tonight.

07:03.470 --> 07:06.460
Gee, it's your reunion, isn't it?!

07:06.570 --> 07:09.560
Don't worry about a thing,
and just go have fun.

07:09.700 --> 07:13.700
But, if I'm away, who knows what kind
of rumors about me will circulate?!

07:15.310 --> 07:18.300
Don't get Nakajima mixed up
in anything, okay?

07:18.450 --> 07:19.310
Are you worried about him?

07:19.310 --> 07:21.110
Are you worried about him?
That's NOT what I mean...

07:21.280 --> 07:23.880
Okay, okay... Get going!
You'll be late!

07:23.990 --> 07:26.780
If you see any cool classmates,
point them in my direction!

07:27.320 --> 07:30.350
Well, then, I'm going.

07:30.460 --> 07:32.090
Take care... Okay?

07:32.260 --> 07:34.230
Have a good trip!

07:38.000 --> 07:41.960
A-ha, she went to
a co-ed school...

07:53.180 --> 07:56.980
Nakajima, are you here?

07:57.250 --> 07:59.980
Oh, my! Lookin' miserable!
What's goin' on?

08:00.090 --> 08:03.080
It wasn't an Omiai, so what're
you worried about?!

08:03.190 --> 08:05.790
Gee... Look, Nakajima, we all know
that you're weak sometimes...

08:05.890 --> 08:08.490
...that when the going gets tough,
you don't get going...

08:08.600 --> 08:13.090
...that you got no guts, are slow, and a
sissy. But, what can you do now?

08:13.200 --> 08:15.230
You can't fight fate,
you know...

08:15.400 --> 08:17.230
H... Hey! This
ain't helping!

08:17.410 --> 08:20.810
At times like this, you've got to
release all that pent-up stress!

08:20.910 --> 08:22.600
And I know just the
place to do that!

08:22.780 --> 08:23.610
What the?

08:23.610 --> 08:24.770
What the?
Oh, c'mon!

08:24.950 --> 08:28.580
That poor ZXR wants you
to take her out for a ride!

08:38.690 --> 08:40.720
Get your butt moving, dude!

08:40.900 --> 08:42.860
You're in our way!

08:50.170 --> 08:52.470
Oh, brother...

08:52.570 --> 08:54.570
Here goes!

08:56.580 --> 08:58.240
You maniac! You tryin' to
kill me or something?!

08:58.410 --> 09:00.440
Nah, I'm reviving you!

09:11.430 --> 09:13.120
I hope that I'll get a commendation
from the Captain for my work...

09:13.230 --> 09:15.820
...I hope that I can keep on talking
to Tokuno every day...

09:15.930 --> 09:17.960
...I hope my lunch-making
skills improve...

09:18.070 --> 09:21.060
...I hope for more samurai
drama re-runs...

09:21.170 --> 09:23.470
...and I hope the summer will be
blessed with good weather...

09:23.570 --> 09:25.600
Okay, let's go buy some
lucky charms!

09:25.770 --> 09:27.640
A lucky charm? What,
for "traffic safety?"

09:27.880 --> 09:29.370
No, for a closer relationship
between you two!

09:29.480 --> 09:33.210
Like the God of Love says,
"Love Shall Flourish!"

09:33.320 --> 09:34.750
Give it to Miyuki, and I'm sure
it'll work out for both of you!

09:35.120 --> 09:37.210
Er... No... I don't wanna
be so blunt!

09:37.390 --> 09:38.620
Don't try to squirm out of this!

09:38.620 --> 09:41.590
Don't try to squirm out of this!
It's not the "buying," it's the "giving..."

09:41.720 --> 09:43.020
Oh, really?

09:43.120 --> 09:45.590
So, that's how you
want it, eh?

09:47.160 --> 09:49.400
"Hotel Taihei Inn"

09:49.400 --> 09:51.590
"Kimizu High School Reunion"

09:50.330 --> 09:51.590
Gee, long time no see!

09:52.330 --> 09:55.240
Miyuki?! You're looking good!

09:55.400 --> 09:57.530
Yeah! A grown-up woman!

09:57.770 --> 10:00.260
You all look different!
I'm speechless!

10:00.610 --> 10:03.270
Hey, Miyuki, you're a cop
now, right? Awesome!

10:03.380 --> 10:04.380
Do you get involved in shootouts?

10:04.380 --> 10:04.550
Do you get involved in shootouts?
No, not really...

10:04.550 --> 10:04.680
No, not really...

10:04.680 --> 10:05.810
Do you get in fights with crooks?
No, not really...

10:05.810 --> 10:05.950
Do you get in fights with crooks?

10:05.950 --> 10:07.020
Do you get in fights with crooks?
No way!

10:07.020 --> 10:07.150
No way!

10:07.150 --> 10:08.180
Do you carry handcuffs and stuff?
No way!

10:08.180 --> 10:08.320
Do you carry handcuffs and stuff?

10:08.320 --> 10:09.310
Do you carry handcuffs and stuff?
W... Well, yeah...

10:17.530 --> 10:20.620
Miyuki went to a co-ed
high school...

10:20.730 --> 10:24.720
...that means, today's reunion...
will also feature men!

10:28.200 --> 10:30.730
First time since graduation, eh?
Well, have some!

10:31.340 --> 10:34.240
Thanks, Kido...

10:39.050 --> 10:42.540
I wonder... if an old boyfriend
might show up or something!

10:43.080 --> 10:45.080
Wanna step out with
me for a while?

10:45.250 --> 10:47.550
Huh? Kido...

10:51.260 --> 10:53.780
That... I can't abide!
And yet...

10:53.960 --> 10:56.400
You don't mind if Miyuki's old
boyfriend grabs her?!

10:56.560 --> 10:57.970
I DO mind!

10:57.970 --> 11:00.300
I DO mind!
Then act! What're you waiting for?!

11:00.470 --> 11:03.600
Taihei Inn, in Katsuura...
Here we come!

11:07.980 --> 11:10.380
It's kind of embarrassing in
front of everyone, isn't it?

11:10.880 --> 11:13.210
Why... now?

11:13.380 --> 11:15.870
I wanted to settle things,
once and for all...

11:19.450 --> 11:22.050
You're slow! A fly
is resting on you!

11:22.220 --> 11:23.880
Shut up, you turtle!

11:33.000 --> 11:36.730
It's all in the past. I've tried
to forget all about it.

11:36.840 --> 11:38.310
Why don't we just forget
that it ever happened?

11:38.470 --> 11:39.740
We can't do that!

11:39.840 --> 11:42.070
Even if you were to forget about it,
it'd always be on my mind...

11:45.510 --> 11:47.570
This is more like it!

11:54.290 --> 11:56.260
Here... The lunch money
you lent me 3 years ago!

11:56.420 --> 11:59.590
At last, I've paid you back!
Boy, it feels good!

11:59.990 --> 12:02.290
Gosh... You haven't
changed at all!

12:02.400 --> 12:06.060
I can never tell whether
you're serious or not!

12:08.000 --> 12:10.700
"Taihei Inn"

12:11.840 --> 12:15.000
I'm sorry, but we don't have
a guest by that name.

12:15.180 --> 12:16.510
This IS the Taihei Inn, isn't it?

12:16.510 --> 12:17.480
This IS the Taihei Inn, isn't it?
Yes, it is.

12:17.480 --> 12:17.610
Yes, it is.

12:17.610 --> 12:18.880
This IS Katsuura City, isn't it?
Yes, it is.

12:18.880 --> 12:19.010
This IS Katsuura City, isn't it?

12:19.010 --> 12:20.610
This IS Katsuura City, isn't it?
Yes, it is.

12:20.780 --> 12:24.880
Er, well... Is there another
Taihei Inn in Katsuura?

12:25.050 --> 12:26.680
We're the only one.

12:26.860 --> 12:29.450
Oh! I know! It's in Chiba!

12:31.060 --> 12:32.690
Katsuura City... in CHIBA
Prefecture!

12:33.730 --> 12:36.030
Miyuki &
Ken & Kido
Natsumi

12:39.600 --> 12:41.570
N... No way...

12:43.910 --> 12:45.900
Oh! He's dead.

12:52.910 --> 12:54.070
Well, so what's
the story?

12:54.250 --> 12:55.120
What do you mean?

12:55.120 --> 12:57.580
What do you mean?
You know... your guy. What's he like?

12:57.750 --> 12:59.550
Is he tall? Out with it!

12:59.720 --> 13:01.120
What's going on? What are
you talking about?

13:01.290 --> 13:05.250
Get this! Satomi is dating
someone from work!

13:05.760 --> 13:07.020
Wow...

13:07.830 --> 13:12.290
I wanted to go out with someone from a
different walk of life, but... I fell for him.

13:12.470 --> 13:14.160
Yeah, that happens!

13:14.340 --> 13:17.100
So, it seems I didn't
need to look far.

13:17.270 --> 13:21.210
It'd be nice for a prince to arrive on
a white stallion, but even so...

13:21.610 --> 13:26.380
Exactly! It's not like I asked
for it, but he came for me!

13:26.550 --> 13:29.310
What do you mean by that, when
you're all blushed up!

13:29.420 --> 13:31.720
We know about being happily in love...
it's written all over your face!

13:31.890 --> 13:33.620
Oh, stop it!

13:33.990 --> 13:35.550
Didn't need to look far, huh?

13:35.720 --> 13:38.620
Look at you, Miyuki! What's
the meaning of that sigh?

13:38.790 --> 13:39.430
Let me guess!

13:39.430 --> 13:41.160
Let me guess!
It's nothing!

13:41.330 --> 13:42.430
Who is he?

13:42.430 --> 13:42.960
Who is he?
What?!

13:42.960 --> 13:43.100
What?!

13:43.100 --> 13:44.270
Just like I thought!
What?!

13:44.270 --> 13:44.400
Just like I thought!

13:44.400 --> 13:46.800
Just like I thought!
No! No! It's not like that at all!

13:46.970 --> 13:48.670
Admit it!

13:48.670 --> 13:49.500
Admit it!
What's he like?

13:49.670 --> 13:51.500
There's no one!
No one!

13:51.670 --> 13:54.160
Besides, I'm just barely
keeping up at work...

13:54.280 --> 13:57.110
There's no time to date a guy or anything
like that... realistically speaking!

13:57.580 --> 14:00.740
Married to your work, eh? You sure
haven't changed at all, Miyuki.

14:00.920 --> 14:03.210
You've always been
that way.

14:03.380 --> 14:07.290
Yeah. It was like, you weren't
interested in guys at all!

14:07.390 --> 14:09.250
Instead, you talked about your
hobbies all the time!

14:09.420 --> 14:11.720
You were actually popular
with the guys, you know?

14:11.830 --> 14:14.420
So I was always thinking,
"Damn! What a waste!"

14:14.600 --> 14:18.230
Miyuki wasn't interested in that, 'cause
she had goals. Right, Miyuki?

14:18.400 --> 14:20.660
I didn't have any ambitions
like that...

14:20.770 --> 14:23.460
All I thought was, "It'd be nice
if I could get married early."

14:23.640 --> 14:26.730
Maybe you expect too much
from life, Miyuki.

14:26.840 --> 14:31.800
I bet you're waiting for someone who's
tall, totally athletic, kind, sweet...

14:31.880 --> 14:36.820
...went to a top school, and makes
the big bucks. Am I right?

14:36.950 --> 14:38.920
W... Well, something
like that...

14:39.090 --> 14:43.490
That'd be a sight to see! I wonder what
Miyuki's significant other will be like?!

14:44.860 --> 14:48.690
Look, Nakajima, everyone screws up now
and then. Besides, you're from Suzuka...

14:48.800 --> 14:51.090
...so you wouldn't know about
the two Katsuura's!

14:51.200 --> 14:54.070
Well, it was partly my fault for not
realizing it along the way, but...

14:54.170 --> 14:56.070
Guess we got carried away with
the drivin', you know!

15:10.250 --> 15:11.780
So I'm a wimp...

15:11.890 --> 15:14.480
...who's weak, and can't take the pressure
when the going gets tough.

15:14.590 --> 15:17.220
I got no guts, I'm slow,
I'm a sissy...

15:17.330 --> 15:22.850
And on top of that, I'm also a klutz, an
oaf, and a dimwit... I'm hopeless!

15:25.430 --> 15:29.160
Nakajima! Pathetic!
You're pathetic!

15:29.400 --> 15:30.630
T... Tsujimoto!

15:30.810 --> 15:33.100
I'll cheer you up!

15:33.440 --> 15:35.380
W... Wait a sec, Tsujimoto!

15:36.740 --> 15:40.010
Drink up and sing out in joy!
Go for it, Nakajima!

15:40.180 --> 15:42.710
Eyaah! Knock it off, Tsujimoto!
We won't be able to go home!

15:42.880 --> 15:44.620
Let's booze it 'til daybreak!

15:44.620 --> 15:46.020
Let's booze it 'til daybreak!
S... Somebody, save me!

15:46.020 --> 15:46.150
S... Somebody, save me!

15:46.150 --> 15:47.120
You're not going anywhere!
S... Somebody, save me!

15:47.120 --> 15:47.260
You're not going anywhere!

15:47.260 --> 15:48.920
You're not going anywhere!
We'll get busted for DWI!

15:48.920 --> 15:49.060
We'll get busted for DWI!

15:49.060 --> 15:50.660
Go for another bottle!
We'll get busted for DWI!

15:50.660 --> 15:50.790
Go for another bottle!

15:50.790 --> 15:53.920
Go for another bottle!
Phew! You reek of Sake!

15:55.030 --> 15:57.260
"Katsuura Station"

15:57.130 --> 15:58.630
Well, I better get going
from here...

15:59.130 --> 16:01.760
I was hoping that we could go to
an aquarium or something.

16:01.940 --> 16:03.530
Too bad. Maybe next time, okay?

16:03.710 --> 16:06.670
Next time, I'll introduce
you to my boyfriend!

16:23.020 --> 16:26.390
At the very least... he's tall.

16:46.710 --> 16:49.440
My! This is yesterday's
evening paper!

16:49.550 --> 16:52.210
If she was going out, Natsumi could've
at least put it inside the apartment!

17:04.230 --> 17:06.500
Miyuki... Is Nakajima home?

17:06.670 --> 17:09.330
N... No. It seems
like he's out.

17:09.500 --> 17:12.410
How could he go out in
this kinda weather?!

17:12.510 --> 17:14.700
I just don't understand this
bike riding thing at all!

17:14.880 --> 17:16.670
Well, I notice that you're also
out and about, Yoriko!

17:16.840 --> 17:20.610
Yeah, well, I have a legitimate
excuse... souvenirs!

17:20.950 --> 17:23.920
I'm like a rat in a trap, eh? Well, make
sure everyone gets a share, okay?

17:24.020 --> 17:25.210
These are those famous
Peanut Rice-Cakes!

17:25.390 --> 17:31.020
I know! Though, I wonder where
Natsumi or Nakajima are...

17:31.960 --> 17:35.120
Well, speak of the devil,
here's Nakajima now...

17:35.530 --> 17:37.020
...and Natsumi?!

17:40.000 --> 17:41.940
C... Coming home
in the morning?!

17:47.210 --> 17:48.940
And? So, what happened?

17:49.110 --> 17:53.170
Well, Nakajima and Tsujimoto went
out touring, and stayed overnight!

17:53.450 --> 17:56.250
While Kobayakawa was out, right?
Is he flirting or something?

17:56.420 --> 17:57.910
Well, I guess that's what
it boils down to.

17:58.090 --> 18:00.650
Hey, don't go around spreading
unsubstantiated rumors.

18:00.820 --> 18:02.790
Y... Yes, sir... Sorry
about that, sir!

18:03.760 --> 18:05.780
The way I heard it, Nakajima's heart
was broken, and he just snapped...

18:05.890 --> 18:08.020
...and asked Tsujimoto out.

18:08.360 --> 18:09.520
Ah...

18:11.630 --> 18:14.660
Allow me to explain...
if you would!

18:24.810 --> 18:30.010
Ummm... Ahem! Er... Miyuki?
Got a minute?

18:30.180 --> 18:31.120
It's okay.

18:31.120 --> 18:32.020
It's okay.
Huh?

18:32.190 --> 18:38.020
I know all about it. You were just trying
to cheer Nakajima up, right?

18:38.190 --> 18:40.520
W... Well... something like that.

18:40.700 --> 18:43.930
Don't worry about it. Rumors
don't mean anything...

18:44.100 --> 18:45.730
Oh! Miyuki, it's full!

18:45.900 --> 18:51.810
Oh! Oh, my! Let me see here...
A rag! Where's a rag?!

18:57.950 --> 19:00.110
"Health Checkup"
"Take Good Care
of Your Teeth"

19:02.650 --> 19:04.020
I heard that you fell.

19:04.190 --> 19:06.210
Y... Yeah. I think it has
to do with this fever...

19:06.390 --> 19:07.910
Fever?! You have a cold
or something?

19:08.090 --> 19:11.420
Uh... it's nothing much. I'm just a
little under the weather, I think...

19:11.590 --> 19:14.220
Oh... Oh, yeah! Thanks
for the tasty souvenir!

19:14.400 --> 19:17.260
I got them for everyone...

19:17.430 --> 19:18.430
I got something for y...

19:18.430 --> 19:20.920
I got something for y...
I gotta get going now. Sorry...

19:21.140 --> 19:24.760
"Notice of Personal Checkup"
"Bokuto Station"

19:22.200 --> 19:26.900
I got something
for you, too...

19:27.980 --> 19:32.170
She said not to worry about it, but I'm sure
she's lying. She looked so upset!

19:32.350 --> 19:35.280
I mean, it's weird NOT
to worry about it.

19:35.450 --> 19:38.320
You just had to say something that was
totally uncalled for, didn't you?!

19:38.490 --> 19:41.320
Natsumi... don't be cruel!

19:43.930 --> 19:48.330
Up 'til now, no matter how upset she was,
she never avoided me like this...

19:48.860 --> 19:51.420
This is serious...

19:51.600 --> 19:54.590
Good grief! I can't take
this anymore!

19:54.770 --> 19:56.630
Wait, Tsujimoto! Where
are you going?!

19:56.800 --> 19:58.740
Someplace nice!

19:58.840 --> 20:00.400
Miyuki!

20:00.510 --> 20:02.940
Nakajima wants
to talk to you!

20:03.040 --> 20:05.880
Go on, tell her how
you really feel!

20:06.410 --> 20:08.410
W... What?! Who, me?!

20:08.580 --> 20:11.110
Come on! Tell her, like a
real man should! Do it!

20:11.290 --> 20:12.270
B... But...

20:12.450 --> 20:14.220
Why you!

20:14.390 --> 20:16.550
Nakajima! Go for it!

20:16.660 --> 20:20.150
Everyone's rooting for you! Now pluck up
your courage, and tell her how you feel!

20:20.330 --> 20:21.390
Nakajima, go for it!

20:21.560 --> 20:23.200
Yeah! Show her what you're made of!

20:23.200 --> 20:24.790
Yeah! Show her what you're made of!
Do it, Nakajima!

20:25.800 --> 20:28.060
Yoriko... you're at it again!

20:28.240 --> 20:29.830
But!

20:30.340 --> 20:32.430
Miyuki, sorry... I didn't mean for
something like this to happen...

20:32.610 --> 20:34.510
You're SO insensitive!

20:34.610 --> 20:37.580
Leave me alone for
a while! Please?

20:49.820 --> 20:52.420
Chief, here are today's reports, sir.
Please look through them.

20:52.590 --> 20:54.120
This many?!

20:54.300 --> 20:56.560
There's more, sir.

20:56.730 --> 20:57.600
Urk!

21:01.970 --> 21:04.030
Natsumi, it's time
to go on patrol.

21:04.210 --> 21:06.170
Oh, okay...

21:11.710 --> 21:13.440
This sure is getting tense!

21:13.610 --> 21:18.050
Our work gets done alright, but
at this rate, WE won't last!

21:18.420 --> 21:22.010
This kind of a love triangle can't
be taken lightly at all!

21:23.360 --> 21:25.330
I have to do something...

21:33.430 --> 21:35.900
Your cold is getting
worse, isn't it?

21:36.070 --> 21:37.370
I'm fine.

21:37.370 --> 21:40.140
I'm fine.
If you say so...

21:48.350 --> 21:52.550
You know, Miyuki... I know that I
can be insensitive sometimes...

21:52.650 --> 21:55.490
...'cause I can't figure certain things out
unless I'm told exactly what's what.

21:55.590 --> 21:57.820
And, I tend to go full speed ahead and
take my best shot, no matter what...

21:57.930 --> 22:00.190
I guess that's why I made
your life hell...

22:00.360 --> 22:04.350
No. Maybe it's ME
who's insensitive.

22:04.470 --> 22:06.800
You see, I don't even know
myself how I feel...

22:08.400 --> 22:10.340
Why do two people
fall in love?

22:10.440 --> 22:14.640
Isn't it because you feel that you
need that certain someone?

22:14.740 --> 22:18.970
But, "need" and "love" aren't
the same thing...

22:19.150 --> 22:20.580
HUH?!

22:20.750 --> 22:22.610
Sorry... I'm acting strange...

22:26.120 --> 22:26.990
Miyuki!

22:26.990 --> 22:29.460
Miyuki!
Alright!

22:31.060 --> 22:33.420
Uh-oh, the cops!

22:34.060 --> 22:35.290
He's making a run for it!

22:35.460 --> 22:37.660
He's probably laughing because
this is just a mini-patrol car.

22:37.770 --> 22:39.730
We won't let him get away!

22:45.940 --> 22:47.460
Natsumi!

22:47.640 --> 22:49.630
Let me!

22:49.740 --> 22:51.110
Hey! Scram!

22:56.150 --> 22:58.710
Whew! Instant reaction! ...- SAFE! ...-
Such a close call!

22:58.890 --> 23:00.220
Thanks, Natsumi.

23:00.390 --> 23:02.380
Don't mention it.

23:02.560 --> 23:03.460
Kobayakawa...

23:03.460 --> 23:05.320
Kobayakawa...
Thanks... Nakajima...

23:05.490 --> 23:07.550
I'm not feeling
well today...

23:10.700 --> 23:15.360
Oh, my! They're totally trashed! And this
was a new pair I just got issued!

23:23.240 --> 23:26.870
I'll go after that punk! You guys
take it easy for now. Adios!

23:27.050 --> 23:29.410
Huh? HUH?!

23:29.520 --> 23:32.780
Why are you taking over for us at
a time like this? You moron!

23:33.020 --> 23:35.220
It's okay.

23:35.320 --> 23:39.880
Nakajima needs
to be like that...

23:40.800 --> 23:42.390
"Japanese Word Processor" "A4 Paper Size" "40 Lines"
"Schedule Proposal"

23:45.070 --> 23:48.830
Recently, we've suffered the undesirable
consequences of a non-trivial situation.

23:48.940 --> 23:52.200
I'm sure that both of you know
all too well what's causing it.

23:52.310 --> 23:54.570
And so, as your chief, I must
officially inform you that...

23:54.680 --> 23:56.640
...you, Miyuki Kobayakawa,
and you, Ken Nakajima...

23:56.740 --> 23:58.040
...in the hopes that you will
regain your friendship...

23:58.150 --> 24:00.880
...are hereby ordered to go
on a date this weekend!

24:00.980 --> 24:02.950
Here is your itinerary.

24:01.680 --> 24:05.380
"Schedule"
"Here I schedule the date ofMiss Kobayakawa and
Mr. Nakajimain order to resolve their issues."

24:03.020 --> 24:05.890
I expect you to scrutinize it carefully
and follow it as exactly as possible!

24:06.050 --> 24:07.190
Yes, sir!

24:07.190 --> 24:09.160
Yes, sir!
Uh...

24:13.890 --> 24:16.520
"Meet her by the Kinshi train
station, at 3 P. M..."

24:16.700 --> 24:18.670
Nakajima...

24:20.870 --> 24:24.200
Kobayakawa... I hope
this works out for us!

24:24.540 --> 24:26.200
M... Me too...

24:36.150 --> 24:38.120
"Bill to: Bokuto Police Station"

24:40.920 --> 24:43.480
Uh... uh... next is
Kinshi Park...

24:44.530 --> 24:48.220
Ostrich 1 to all officers; the subjects are
heading towards the final destination!

24:48.860 --> 24:52.420
They are behaving informally. Date is
proceeding according to plan. Over!

24:52.600 --> 24:55.190
Roger! Natsumi? Yoriko?
Did you get that?

24:55.640 --> 24:57.630
Roger! And now, we
get to see the finale!

24:58.570 --> 25:00.600
They've just passed "Checkpoint
Charlie!" Over!

25:01.180 --> 25:04.080
Confirmed sighting of the subjects!
I shall continue the stakeout.

25:09.050 --> 25:13.150
I feel bad, making you hang out with me
all day, when you've just been sick...

25:13.320 --> 25:15.450
You shouldn't, because I'm
perfectly fine now.

25:15.560 --> 25:17.520
Oh, yeah!

25:18.160 --> 25:20.150
I've washed it for
you. Thanks!

25:21.500 --> 25:25.960
I... 'cause Tsujimoto told me... NO!
I mean, I wanted you to have this!

25:26.470 --> 25:29.160
YES! Good going! "Love
Shall Flourish!"

25:29.340 --> 25:30.860
"Traffic Safety?"

25:31.270 --> 25:31.860
WHAT?!

25:32.040 --> 25:35.570
We're in the traffic safety
department, after all!

25:36.480 --> 25:39.450
Even though we were ordered to be
here, I'm happy that this happened.

25:39.610 --> 25:41.170
Me, too.

25:44.080 --> 25:46.380
Thank you, Nakajima.

25:51.160 --> 25:53.920
Don't you wanna peek?
It's looking good!

25:54.090 --> 25:56.060
Oh, well...

26:04.940 --> 26:07.640
We've just been notified of a car crash
in front of the train station.

26:07.810 --> 26:10.540
Everyone, abort the current operation
and head over to the scene. Over.

26:11.080 --> 26:13.050
Roger!

26:14.050 --> 26:14.850
Time for work!

26:14.850 --> 26:16.820
Time for work!
Okay, let's go!

26:17.450 --> 26:20.680
Wait, Nakajima!

26:21.060 --> 26:27.320
<i>After the rain, scattered diamonds come.</i>

26:21.990 --> 26:24.490
Natsumi! You're over there, aren't you?
C'mon, let's get going!

26:24.630 --> 26:25.530
S... Sure!

26:26.290 --> 26:29.130
Right! Yoriko, you take care of the stuff!

26:27.430 --> 26:31.130
<i>We'll be crossing bridges of rainbows...</i>

26:29.260 --> 26:31.600
It was just getting good!

26:31.230 --> 26:34.830
<i>... nonstop, no matter what we face.</i>

26:31.730 --> 26:35.070
Yahoo! Well... we just happened
to be walking nearby, and...

26:34.940 --> 26:44.740
<i>I don't like chicken-hearted softies... You're Under Arrest!</i>

26:36.070 --> 26:44.710
<i>Next time... ask me out without the</i>
<i>plan and without the entourage!</i>
<i>I don't like chicken-hearted softies... You're UnderArrest!</i>

27:07.370 --> 27:15.710
<i>I love the smile you always have.</i>
<i>With all the passion I have...</i>

27:15.780 --> 27:25.110
<i>... I will protect you from sighs.</i>

27:25.220 --> 27:33.060
<i>The sunset skyline flashes past</i>
<i>in my side-view mirror.</i>

27:33.130 --> 27:40.620
<i>This is the road I drive on every day,</i>
<i>believing in my dreams.</i>

27:40.730 --> 27:48.530
<i>On rainy days, windy days, and days</i>
<i>when I wanted to throw it all away...</i>

27:48.640 --> 27:56.370
<i>... you smiled as you</i>
<i>sat beside me.</i>

27:57.650 --> 28:02.160
<i>I love the unchanging vista, the sky</i>
<i>that we watch together.</i>
<i>I love the unchanging vista, the sky</i>
<i>that we watch together.</i>
<i>I love the unchanging vista, the sky</i>
<i>that we watch together.</i>

28:06.160 --> 28:12.970
<i>That's why I'm confident that I can</i>
<i>hang in there, if it's for you.</i>

28:13.030 --> 28:21.470
<i>I love the smile you always have.</i>
<i>With all the passion I have...</i>

28:21.540 --> 28:21.680
<i>... I will protect you from sighs.</i>

28:28.020 --> 28:28.050
<i>I love this town where we</i>
<i>happened to meet...</i>

28:41.200 --> 28:44.100
"And Speaking of
Our Heroines..."

28:41.700 --> 28:46.260
Natsumi, it was a short year being your
partner and all, but it was great fun!

28:46.370 --> 28:47.590
I'll never forget you!

28:47.770 --> 28:50.860
Huh? Miyuki, you make it
sound like a farewell.

28:51.040 --> 28:52.910
Natsumi! Don't go! Waah!

28:52.910 --> 28:54.170
Natsumi! Don't go! Waah!
"Go?!" Where to?!

28:54.340 --> 28:56.470
Tsujimoto! It won't be the
same without you!

28:56.580 --> 28:58.200
Take care! Here's a Going-
Away present!

28:58.380 --> 28:59.940
All of us at Bokuto Police Station
are proud of you guys.

29:00.050 --> 29:01.880
We look forward to seeing you triumph
in your future endeavors!

29:02.050 --> 29:05.140
See you again in You're Under Arrest,
File 4, "On The Road, Again."

29:05.250 --> 29:06.650
Natsumi! It's our last assignment!

29:06.820 --> 29:11.050
Oh, I don't know what's going on,
but I'll take my best shot at it!
